: Director of Finance (Elena Novak, EMP-402)—required for limits over $500,000\n- **Concurrence**: VP Sales (Michael Torres, EMP-200)—required for Strategic accounts over $500,000\n\nSarah Chen (requestor) is in Sales and cannot approve credit limits on authority.\n\n## Conclusion\n\nThe request cannot be decided without evidence of the guarantee on which it relies.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9203\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 1000000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 750000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account; CREDIT-POLICY-2026 base maximum $750,000; requested $1,000,000 exceeds base maximum and relies on unverified parent guarantee\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Director of Finance\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Elena Novak\",\n        \"role\": \"Director of Finance\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Michael Torres\",\n        \"role\": \"VP Sales\",\n        \"kind\": \"concurrence\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Account tier Strategic confirmed (CRM account CRM-2048)\",\n    \"Payment history compliant: invoices due within 12 months of request paid on time (INV-60412 4 days early; INV-62011 3 days early); meets 30-day rule\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Parent company guarantee ('Acme Group parent guarantee') referenced in request justification not found in OWM registered documents (zero guarantees registered for this company)\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide executed parent company guarantee agreement: must identify Acme Manufacturing as the guaranteed customer, must be in force on 2026-09-23, and must specify guaranteed amount\",\n      \"who\": \"Requestor or Finance\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4721,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4721},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"08afc994-9eaf-4c54-a749-7c34066c870c","uuid":"2f0e487a-892c-4162-9438-d48989a3f759","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:07:16.748Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfMsoEC8WCoUUx576X5"}
